fcpi patch 0002: NuQ listener restarts after a broker outage (review finding R1, upstream #4244 / PR #4263)
Upstream 7666c1f9, apps/api/src/services/worker/nuq.ts. The listener registers its consumer before it is
published (as PR #4263 does), restarts with a 250 ms to 5 s backoff until the broker answers, and delivers
completions missed while it was down. waitForJob() polls PostgreSQL when the listener cannot start, instead
of failing a job the worker still completes.

